const introParagraphs = [
  "<strong>When an appliance fails in Carpinteria, our techs at Same Day Appliance Repair are working the saltiest air on our whole South Coast route: this town sits directly on the beach, and refrigerators a block or two off Linden Avenue corrode condenser coils faster than anywhere else we service. Add the vacation-rental rhythm — machines idle for three weeks, then hammered by a full house over a holiday weekend — and Carpinteria calls have their own personality. We dispatch same-day across the beach neighborhoods, Concha Loma, and the Via Real corridor. $89 residential diagnostic, waived with repair. BHGS #A49573, EPA 608 Universal certified (#1346255700410), BBB Accredited.</strong>",
  "Carpinteria's charm is that it stayed a real beach town — bungalows and cottages walkable to the sand, the Linden Avenue main street, campgrounds by the state beach. For appliances, that geography is a stress test. Salt air doesn't respect a two-block buffer: coils, door gaskets, outdoor grill igniters, and anything metal in a garage with the door open all age on the accelerated coastal schedule. On every Carpinteria refrigerator call, coil condition is the first thing we look at, because it's the cause behind half the symptoms.",
  "Then there's the rental rhythm. From Sandyland Cove to Padaro Lane, a large share of Carpinteria's housing is second homes and short-term rentals. Appliances there live a strange life: nothing for weeks, then five loads of laundry, three dishwasher runs a day, and an ice maker working overtime for a long weekend. Idle time is its own failure mode — seals dry, standing water evaporates out of traps, and the first guest of the season finds the fault. We do pre-season checkouts for exactly this reason, and our <a href=\"/for-business/airbnb-short-term-rentals/\">short-term rental service</a> page covers how we work with hosts and managers on turnovers.",
  "The edges of town are a different world: the greenhouse and nursery belt that made Carpinteria a flower-growing capital. Those operations run commercial coolers and breakroom kitchens alongside residential-grade equipment in offices and farmstands. We service the residential-grade side under this page's pricing; for walk-ins and true commercial refrigeration, our <a href=\"/commercial/refrigeration/\">commercial team</a> handles it from the same branch.",
  `Diagnostic fee: <strong>$89</strong> — waived with repair. Written estimate before we start. <strong>90-day warranty</strong> on parts and labor. Call <a href="tel:${phoneRaw}">${branch.phone}</a> for same-day service across 93013 — and the rest of the <a href="/santa-barbara-county/">South Coast corridor</a>.`
];

